<code>assert this.size() == \result.size() && \forall E e; this.contains(e) => \result.contains(e);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert this.equals(\result);</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \result.size() == this.size() && \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < \result.size(); \result.contains(this.toArray()[i]);</code>

This assert statement checks that the cloned set has the same size as the original set and that every element in the original set is also contained in the cloned set.
